  planner_response {
    response: "I have built **Stadio Atelier**, a technical football store web application for match footwear, player-issue kits, thermally bonded match balls, and goalkeeper equipment.\n\n### Key Features\n- **Campaign Hero & Technical Proof**: Split-screen showcase of the *Veloce Carbon XI* firm-ground boot with interactive engineering callouts (*11-Ply Biaxial Carbon Chassis*, *Hydrophobic Fly-Weave*, *Anatomical Calcaneus Lock*) and a 4-column quantitative proof strip.\n- **Equipment Catalog & Surface Filtering**: Filter products by category (*Footwear*, *Match Kits*, *Balls & GK*), pitch traction (*FG Firm Grass*, *SG-Pro Wet Turf*, *AG 3G/4G Artificial*), keyword search, and sort by price or boot mass.\n- **Contiguous Product Detail Module (PDP)**: Inspect technical specifications, switch between `EU`, `UK`, `US`, and `CM` sizing scales, select stud/cut configurations (`FG`, `SG-Pro`, `AG`), and add custom laser heel IDs or squad numbers.\n- **Custom Atelier Lab & Sizing Calibrator**: Configure live player-issue personalization (back name, heel ID, and squad number) and use the interactive foot-length and match-sock thickness calculator to find the exact EU/UK/US last size.\n- **Match Bag, COD Checkout & Order Verification**: Slide-over bag with quantity controls, complimentary express courier threshold tracking, Cash on Delivery (COD) or Direct Settlement verification form, and instant itemized order confirmation receipts."
    modified_response: "I have built **Stadio Atelier**, a technical football store web application for match footwear, player-issue kits, thermally bonded match balls, and goalkeeper equipment.\n\n### Key Features\n- **Campaign Hero & Technical Proof**: Split-screen showcase of the *Veloce Carbon XI* firm-ground boot with interactive engineering callouts (*11-Ply Biaxial Carbon Chassis*, *Hydrophobic Fly-Weave*, *Anatomical Calcaneus Lock*) and a 4-column quantitative proof strip.\n- **Equipment Catalog & Surface Filtering**: Filter products by category (*Footwear*, *Match Kits*, *Balls & GK*), pitch traction (*FG Firm Grass*, *SG-Pro Wet Turf*, *AG 3G/4G Artificial*), keyword search, and sort by price or boot mass.\n- **Contiguous Product Detail Module (PDP)**: Inspect technical specifications, switch between `EU`, `UK`, `US`, and `CM` sizing scales, select stud/cut configurations (`FG`, `SG-Pro`, `AG`), and add custom laser heel IDs or squad numbers.\n- **Custom Atelier Lab & Sizing Calibrator**: Configure live player-issue personalization (back name, heel ID, and squad number) and use the interactive foot-length and match-sock thickness calculator to find the exact EU/UK/US last size.\n- **Match Bag, COD Checkout & Order Verification**: Slide-over bag with quantity controls, complimentary express courier threshold tracking, Cash on Delivery (COD) or Direct Settlement verification form, and instant itemized order confirmation receipts."
